@startuml
title Slice 2: 評価・ルーブリックの中核クラス図
caption 生成AIが提出物とログを基に評価を行い、スコアとフィードバックを返す設計

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 15
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

class Student {
  + studentId: String
  + name: String
  + viewEvaluation()
  + requestRevision()
}

class Submission {
  + submissionId: String
  + studentId: String
  + taskId: String
  + submittedCode: String
  + status: SubmissionStatus
  + evaluationTarget: Boolean
}

class Evaluation {
  + evaluationId: String
  + submissionId: String
  + taskId: String
  + status: EvaluationStatus
  + overallScore: Integer
  + processAnalysis: String
  + feedback: String
  + createdAt: DateTime
  + beginEvaluation()
  + completeEvaluation()
  + requestRevision()
}

class Rubric {
  + rubricId: String
  + version: String
  + title: String
  + criteriaList: List<Criterion>
  + evaluate(submission: Submission, logs: List<CodeLog>): Evaluation
}

class Criterion {
  + criterionId: String
  + name: String
  + weight: Integer
  + description: String
  + score: Integer
  + rationale: String
}

class ScoreResult {
  + scoreId: String
  + evaluationId: String
  + criterionId: String
  + value: Integer
  + reasoning: String
}

class EvidenceRef {
  + evidenceId: String
  + evaluationId: String
  + codeSection: String
  + logTimestamp: DateTime
  + summary: String
}

class Feedback {
  + feedbackId: String
  + evaluationId: String
  + level: FeedbackLevel
  + message: String
  + priority: String
}

class CodeLog {
  + logId: String
  + submissionId: String
  + timestamp: DateTime
  + eventType: LogEventType
  + snapshotText: String
}

class Teacher {
  + teacherId: String
  + reviewEvaluation()
  + confirmResult()
  + requestReevaluation()
}

Student "1" --> "0..*" Submission : 提出
Student "1" --> "0..*" Evaluation : 結果を参照

Submission "1" --> "0..*" CodeLog : 操作ログを持つ
Submission "1" --> "0..1" Evaluation : 評価対象

Rubric "1" --> "0..*" Criterion : 各観点を持つ
Rubric "1" --> "0..*" Evaluation : 評価の基準になる

Evaluation "1" --> "0..*" ScoreResult : 得点を持つ
Evaluation "1" --> "0..*" EvidenceRef : 根拠を持つ
Evaluation "1" --> "0..*" Feedback : フィードバックを持つ

Teacher "1" --> "0..*" Evaluation : 結果を確認

note right of Rubric
  prompt版管理とrubric版管理を前提とし
  評価対象ごとに版を固定する
end note

note bottom of Evaluation
  processAnalysis はコード編集ログと
  提出内容からの分析を含む
end note

@enduml
